        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS44BU32D-R, 4\" x 4\" Residential Stainless Steel Hinge with 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10  x 1\" wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-SS44BU32D-R_size.gif?v=1704354720\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS44BU32D-R Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SS44BU32D-R 4\" x 4\" Stainless Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings: 2BB\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10  x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SS44BU32D-R.pdf?v=1691095382\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS44BU32D-R Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
